1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
成都的咖啡馆，
In Chengdu, the cafés —

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,500
为啥开在茶馆隔壁？
why right next to the teahouses?

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,800
这边盖碗茶，那边手冲。
Gaiwan tea here, pour-over there.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,000
一个下午，两种杯子。
One afternoon, two kinds of cups.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,200
咖啡馆数量，全国第二。
Second-most cafés in all of China.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,400
老茶客，也点起了美式。
Even old tea-drinkers now order coffee.

7
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,600
喝啥不重要，巴适就行。
What you drink? Just be "bashi."

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,600
关注，带你喝懂中国。
Follow — taste China with me.
